      "source": [
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "## Example: Diabetes dataset\n",
        "\n",
        "We now use the diabetes regression dataset from `sklearn`. In order to compare results using trees, we use the same split with `random_state=1`."
      ],
      "id": "1a1c8397"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "import numpy as np\n",
